                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "Optimizing your medications can help improve your health. That\u2019s why we are working with Arine to offer you a medication management program \u2014 at no extra cost \u2014 to help ensure you take medications that are safe and effective for your health conditions as prescribed by your doctor.",
