                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "string": "<b>Better Health \u2014</b> A clinical pharmacist will make sure you are taking the right medications for your health conditions and help you understand how to correctly take all of your medications."
                            }
                        ],
                        [
                            {
                                "storage": {
                                    "path": "org_logo/UHC_safety.png",
                                    "type": "s3"
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "string": "<b>Increased safety \u2014</b> Some medications may cause side effects or may not work well when taken with other medications. A clinical pharmacist will provide tips on how to manage any side effects and make sure your combination of medications is safe."
                            }
                        ],
                        [
                            {
                                "storage": {
